+  // ============================================================================
+  // Quantum-Resistant Stateless Hash-Based Signatures (SLH-DSA / SPHINCS+-SHA256)
+  // ============================================================================
+  // Implements a stateless hash-based signature scheme using WOTS+ (Winternitz
+  // One-Time Signature Plus, w=16) + FORS-lite subset chains + Merkle authentication
+  // hypertree with domain-separated SHA-256 tweakable hash functions.
